### 5.2 Naming Conventions

**Packages:**
```
@nexus/{package-name}  (all lowercase, hyphens)
```

**Collections (Firestore):**
```
organizations, workspaces, websites, pages, users
workflows, ai_agents, prompts, templates, components
(lowercase, underscores for multi-word)
```

**API Endpoints:**
```
/api/v1/{resource}/{subresource}/{action}
GET    /api/v1/organizations
POST   /api/v1/organizations
GET    /api/v1/organizations/{orgId}
GET    /api/v1/organizations/{orgId}/websites
(lowercase, hyphens, plural nouns)
```

**Components:**
```
export default function MyComponentName() { }
// file: MyComponentName.tsx
// usage: <MyComponentName prop1="value" />
```

**Hooks:**
```
export function useMyHook() { }
// file: useMyHook.ts
// usage: const value = useMyHook()
```

**Types:**
```
export type MyType = { };
export interface MyInterface { }
// file: my-type.ts or my-interface.ts
```

**Constants:**
```
export const MY_CONSTANT = 'value';
// file: constants.ts
```

